| switch1 (CS path) | **UP** — `<BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP>` | both UP — CS works fine |

- `brctl show br0` on switch0 confirms eth0 and eth1 are enslaved to the bridge — the bridge is built, just never brought up.
- `it_hod` (192.168.1.2/24) is correctly configured; router0 eth0 (192.168.1.1/24) is UP.
